demo1    Demonstrates the process of checking, suggesting changes to and fixing location names within a dataset.
demo2.1    Shows how to process a datasets of wrong locations, using the relevant functions to identify the misspellings, create a typos dataframe and finally fix the misspellings.
demo2.2    Shows how to process and fix a datasets of wrong locations. Unlike demo2.1, demo2.2 assumes that a typos dataframe is already available.
